{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-11_end","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-11","title":"使徒","storyCode":"14-12","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-11_end.txt","sourceHash":"252db76a427bfe3f55cbfb0a5b386c91c0ae08ece78836128a1f6924d376fde6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在這裡啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……臨光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你難得回一趟本艦，不多陪陪麗茲嗎？她很想你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她剛睡著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你，看上去比以前更疲憊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是在擔心麗茲嗎？我問過凱爾希醫生，她說麗茲的病情還在可控範圍內——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是……有什麼你們沒告訴我的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想……徹底“治癒”麗茲的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為這事已經花費了很多年了，不可能一蹴而就的。別太折磨自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果……我說方法一直在那裡，只是我不敢觸碰呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……閃靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底藏了什麼心事？難道連我都不能說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光，這是我自己需要面對的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你覺得我和麗茲會離開你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明很清楚，這是最不可能發生的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我擔心的……從來都是你們會受到傷害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經決定和麗茲一起找到回憶。我會陪伴她……直到真相揭曉的那一刻。但如果……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在必要的時刻，我需要你替我保護麗茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我會保護的，會與之並肩作戰的……不是只有麗茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閃靈，我也會為你而戰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們從來都是同伴。使徒是一體的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的誓言依舊不變——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你們需要，瑪嘉烈·臨光還有她的劍槍，會隨時為你們而來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g7_confessariusaltar_on"},{"type":"narration","text":"劍槍橫掃。\n耀眼的光芒逼退了一眾敵人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的每一個赦罪師……都是強敵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閃靈，難怪你不願意和我對戰訓練。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們替羅德島省了不少錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最大的敵人……還在前面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們儘量速戰速決。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……兒戲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能扛住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閃靈，我的盾會掩護你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只需要……前進。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巫術的洪流湧向她們。\n瑪嘉烈的光芒竟被壓了下去。\n奎薩圖什塔站在台階最高處，掌心翻湧著晨昏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你找來的幫手嗎？奎薩辛娜，你將我們的儀式現場當作什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"供馬匹比賽取樂的……草原？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，她的源石技藝竟能暫時阻隔我對你的影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那又如何呢？你的劍術，你的源石技藝，全部都來自我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有我的允許，你怎麼可能……傷到我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"變慢了……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的法術……作用於時間感知？還是別的影響……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閃靈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的盾……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這面新盾牌還是第一次出現裂痕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過沒關係，我會用源石技藝補上缺口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在需要保護的人身前，騎士的盾不會這麼脆弱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……令人厭惡的光芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小馬駒，像你這樣的天馬……我過去殺死過不知多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把他們金色的血抹在我那座卡茲戴爾的城牆上——讓我的城市看起來永遠都沐浴在黎明的光輝中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的話，他們的後代就會明白，卡茲戴爾不是可以肆意侵犯的領地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這可不是在卡茲戴爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不是什麼保家衛國的英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"英雄流自己的血，為其他人開道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你——我只見到，你登上王座的道路上，鋪滿他人的血淚與屍骨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"英雄？我早就不想做什麼英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人人傳唱，人人敬仰……卻依舊如沙土般易逝。不管我怎麼舞弄光陰，時間都不會為我停駐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會死去，我建立的城市會崩塌。我所愛著的子民，也不得不繼續流離失所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這無望的循環……折磨著每一個薩卡茲，也折磨著我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我身為君主，我有責任，有能力，理應從源頭處改變薩卡茲的命運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要能令薩卡茲不再匍匐於你們這些野獸的腳下，只要能令我的卡茲戴爾在無數個晨昏中永存不滅——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伴隨著奎薩圖什塔的話語，周圍全部的光都在朝他掌心湧去。\n瑪嘉烈的源石技藝，其他赦罪師的法術光輝，以及……被濃厚雲層過濾的，僅剩的日光。\n懸在他掌心的那頂小小的荊棘冠冕，就像一片不容置喙的黑夜。\n石床上的夜鶯也跟著浮了起來。\n她依然眼睛緊閉，四肢無力，雙臂卻不由自主地張開——\n等到最後一片光也被囚禁的那一刻，冠冕就會落到奎薩圖什塔的頭頂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗茲……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閃靈，沿著我的光！去救她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"最後一抹銳利的光如同投槍，撕開一路的巫術屏障。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"閃靈來到奎薩圖什塔身前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑夜如囚籠般降臨，唯一的光，來自她的劍。\n那是在劍鋒上停駐的，靈魂之火閃爍的痕跡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……麗茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我把曾被我奪走的，最真實的記憶還給你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因為我探索靈魂的執念……我沒有抹除雕刻你時留下的那些——不必要的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你……甦醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你開始擁有情感，有所回應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"實驗仍在繼續，我不得不……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想，你至少會好受一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你會感覺到，自己是真實活著的，也曾擁有過……一點溫暖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你早就該想起來了……麗茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定記得，我們全部的約定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"藍色的羽獸在黑暗中浮現。\n巨大的灰白色眼球注視著閃靈，緩緩落下一滴眼淚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g7_confessariusaltar_on"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"半空中的人緩緩地下墜。\n在凝滯的時間中，閃靈和瑪嘉烈同時聽到了夜鶯的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得的，閃靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你帶著我一路從最黑的房間裡逃出去……陪伴著我四處求醫……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後我們遇到了臨光，我們三個人一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們去了很多地方，救了很多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你常常在半夜皺眉嘆氣……但只要我睜開眼睛，你就會換上最溫柔的語調，跟我說一路上我錯過的美好的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光好幾次試著教我跳舞，拉著我轉啊轉……我轉不動了，你們就會一起扶著我……輪流背我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你們身邊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我彷彿……真的會飛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們一起，讓我成為了現在的我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是使徒的一員……一名醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也會保護你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也會，與你們並肩作戰，斬斷最深的罪孽，拯救……將被永恆黑夜籠罩的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們三個人的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……約定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i09"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i09"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜鶯落到了地面上。\n極致的光芒自她的法杖中、身體裡釋放。\n巨大的囚籠顯現，反過來將奎薩圖什塔的身軀捕捉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明明靈魂完全在我手中，這囚籠為何——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有名字的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我叫麗茲，是你的敵人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奎薩圖什塔，我阻止你……是因為你說的每一句話，我都不同意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g7_confessariusaltar_on"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閃靈、臨光……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"閃靈握緊了劍。\n瑪嘉烈擲出了劍槍，槍尖正中奎薩圖什塔手中旋轉的荊棘冠冕。\n三人毫無差錯地領悟了彼此心中所想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在晨昏再度被掌控之前，抓住那一線靈魂之火閃爍的微光。\n綿長血色的唯一一道裂縫，的確就在眼前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找到了，你靈魂的本質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奎薩辛娜……你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這副身軀會變成什麼樣……我並不擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我的意志會被血脈掌控，那麗茲和臨光會替此刻的我，對我下達判決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我決不會成為你的傀儡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會替你去征服，去統治。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至死……我都一定是自由的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就試試看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奎薩辛娜，我們不會輕易分離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"試試看，從我身邊……再逃開一次。試試看……能逃多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會再逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會——給予你唯一且永恆的死亡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"閃靈——後退！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"樹梢上的月亮滾落懸崖，地面劇烈地晃動著，如同要上下顛倒一般。\n祭壇崩潰，金色的源石漿液湧出缺口。\n一個身影不知何時走來，沒有人察覺到他的動作。他的速度並不快，卻恰到好處地擋在了奎薩圖什塔與使徒中間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該走了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奎薩圖什塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_654_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵……竟然是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"使徒……是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這個勇氣貧瘠的時代，你們的光芒，堪稱奪目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀利喀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1332_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還會再見面的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"喀利喀和奎薩圖什塔的身影沒入祭壇的殘骸中。\n其他赦罪師緊隨其後。\n那頂被光槍擊落的荊棘冠冕突然旋轉起來，化作一道漆黑的虛影，往天空飛去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……碎片大廈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那風暴中央的是……通訊中說的“阿喃那”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生和博士他們……能趕上嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閃靈，你……呃，沒感覺有什麼不對勁吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這血脈詛咒確實很複雜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，麗茲……麗茲？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗茲……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的靈魂……為什麼不完整？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛難道是以撕裂靈魂為代價……反抗了奎薩圖什塔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閃靈……臨光……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在的，麗茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒關係的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們保護了我很久……這次，也可以換我來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……想和你們……永遠……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗茲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"治療，閃靈，我們一起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閃靈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的源石技藝，在這樣的環境下，沒有辦法彌合這麼嚴重的靈魂創傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗茲從身體到靈魂，本就無比特殊。她誕生於一個巧合……不，我更願意稱它為奇蹟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先離開這裡，再計劃下一步行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奎薩圖什塔呢，要放他離開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起麗茲的安危，他的死活根本不值一提——他早已不再重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我們回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我們一起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g8_altarcoreandblood"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……首領。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（憤怒的咆哮）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奎薩圖什塔囚禁黑冠的計劃失敗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祭壇的力量變弱了……我可以克服它的影響——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祭壇上層已開始崩潰。阿米婭，集中攻擊“提卡茲之血”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王已經宣判過我的死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過是，再來一次罷了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明……很痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你如此敬愛奎薩圖什塔，可他這麼輕易地拋下了你。他看待你，就和你看待那些奇美拉造物……沒有區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別費心了，“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的情感沒什麼特別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赦罪師，本就全都是首領的血脈。不過有的天生擁有更完美的肉體……比如奎薩辛娜。還有的，比如我，從來不可能被選中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我從不嫉妒她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是，各自都在合適的位置上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本我們可以相親相愛。我們互為手足……宛如一體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有任何一個團體能像赦罪師一般，締造前人未見的奇蹟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你很執著。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"……冥頑不靈。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也有自己好奇的事啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你沒有嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“博士”……為了你一生的事業，為了你愛著的，與你一路奮戰至此的人……你難道，不會做出和我一樣的選擇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是否被控制……是否被影響，都已經無關緊要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抵達原點，創造一個全新的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我想要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能……讓你靠近“提卡茲之血”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈……啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色線條再次貫穿薩盧斯的身軀，同時刺穿了祭壇的中心。\n“提卡茲之血”凝滯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明明已經很近了……呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，阻止她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她想引爆——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係……沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的身體……就像怪物一樣……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她將殘破的手伸向那滴血紅。\n一段只有赦罪師知道的咒言，基於靈魂，基於全部的血和肉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次，我大概會徹底死去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先於首領，先於奎薩辛娜，先於我所有的家人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩盧斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_653_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走進我所嚮往的……未來之中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩盧斯微笑著，撲向了那顆停滯的心臟。\n“提卡茲之血”沸騰了。\n巨大的赤紅色漩渦出現在祭壇中心——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在那一瞬，阿米婭感到自己正被注視著。\n被奎薩圖什塔，被無名的戴冠之人，被咆哮的眾魂……還有她最熟悉的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭小姐……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“阿喃那”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩盧斯用自己的血完成了赦罪師的儀式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快走，離開這個祭壇！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
